<%- include("partials/head.ejs") %>
<%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>

<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
  <section class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr]">
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 sm:p-12">
      <p class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-cyan-300/20 bg-cyan-300/10 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-200">About the platform</p>
      <h1 class="display-font mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Built for creators who want a cleaner publishing loop</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">Bloggers Network was refreshed to feel current, fast, and useful. It now connects login, registration, contact, and blog publishing through an in-memory SQLite backend so the app behaves like a small product rather than a static brochure.</p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-5">
          <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white"><%= stats.members %></p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Members</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-5">
          <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white"><%= stats.posts %></p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Posts</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-5">
          <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white"><%= stats.messages %></p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Messages</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60">
      <img src="/images/digitalhub.jpg" alt="Modern creator workspace" class="h-full w-full object-cover">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
    <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">Focus</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 display-font text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Readable layouts</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">The layout was rebuilt to emphasize content hierarchy instead of default bootstrap spacing.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">Auth</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 display-font text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Real sign-in flow</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">Login now checks both email and password against salted hashes in SQLite-backed user records.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">Publishing</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 display-font text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Post creation</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">Authenticated users can publish content and upload an image without leaving the page flow.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">UX</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 display-font text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Mobile first</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">Forms, nav, and content cards resize cleanly on smaller screens so the app still feels deliberate.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">What changed</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
        <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">Static screens were replaced with data-driven pages.</li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">The auth middleware now resolves the signed-in user from a session cookie.</li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">Blog posts are stored and rendered from an in-memory SQLite table.</li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">The UI uses Tailwind CDN, richer spacing, and clearer calls to action.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-400/15 via-slate-950 to-slate-950 p-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-200">Mission</p>
      <h2 class="display-font mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Help creators publish faster and present better.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">The point of the refresh is not just visual polish. It is to make the product easier to understand, easier to use, and easier to extend as the content model grows.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/register" class="rounded-full bg-cyan-400 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-cyan-300">Join the network</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10">Browse blog</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>